### 5. Cтатический NAT(PAT) для офиса Чокурдах.

#### R28 - NAT(PAT)

```
access-list 1 permit 10.3.30.0 0.0.0.255
access-list 1 permit 192.168.99.0 0.0.0.255
!
interface Ethernet0/2.30
 ip nat inside
 exit
!
interface Ethernet0/2.99
 ip nat inside
 exit
!
interface Ethernet0/0
 ip nat outside
 exit
!
interface Ethernet0/1
 ip nat outside
 exit
!
route-map ETH0 permit 10
 match ip address 1
 match interface Ethernet0/0
 exit
!
route-map ETH1 permit 10
 match ip address 1
 match interface Ethernet0/1
 exit
!
ip nat inside source route-map ETH0 interface Ethernet0/0 overload
ip nat inside source route-map ETH1 interface Ethernet0/1 overload
